backups/

# GSD executor worktrees — transient, created and removed per wave
.claude/worktrees/

# Phase 4 host-capability probe (D4-06). scripts/host-probe/run-probe.sh
# materialises the token-substituted probe here for exactly as long as the
# upload takes, then deletes it. The template it is generated FROM lives under
# scripts/ and is committed; this instance carries a live access token and a
# body that reports ini values, the extension list and filesystem paths, so it
# must never reach a commit. Belt to the template's braces — P-10's real
# mitigation is keeping the source out of src/ entirely.
/src/hc-*.php
